+# create-tauri-app
+
+Run and answer the prompts to get started with your first Tauri app!
+
+With npx:
+
+```shell
+npx create-tauri-app
+```
+
+With npm:
+
+```shell
+npm x create-tauri-app
+```
+
+With yarn:
+
+```shell
+yarn create tauri-app
+```
+
+# Additional Args
